cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this software integration, the original STCA paper, and the
  pinned author implementation when using this work.
type: software
title: STCA Agent Skill
version: '0.1.0'
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Weihao
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0005-4445-7074
abstract: >-
  Agent workflows for applying published Sliding Threshold Correlation
  Analysis rules, deriving and evaluating rules from measured data, and
  proposing polymer repeat-unit candidates followed by explicit H-cap,
  MACCS generation and frozen structural-rule verification. This integration
  calls the pinned original polymer-stca implementation.
keywords:
  - STCA
  - polymers
  - interpretable screening
  - agent skills
  - molecular design
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Interpretable substructure-based screening of multi-property polymer
      dielectrics with prompt-ready rules for rational design
